MintCurveConvexPosition::addCollateral(uint256)
├── given caller is not owner and not authorized spender
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
└── given caller is owner or authorized spender
    ├── when amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
    └── when amount is greater than zero
        ├── given owner has not approved the position for amount of collateral
        │   └── it should revert with ERC20InsufficientAllowance
        ├── given owner holds less than amount of collateral
        │   └── it should revert with ERC20InsufficientBalance
        ├── given owner has approved and holds at least amount of collateral
        │   ├── it should pull amount of collateral from the owner
        │   ├── it should add amount of collateral to the mint market on behalf of the position
        │   ├── it should reset the market collateral allowance to zero
        │   └── it should emit CollateralAdded
        └── given caller is an authorized spender
            ├── it should pull amount of collateral from the caller
            └── it should add amount of collateral to the mint market on behalf of the position
